ehearsal eligible rows: 3530\n- Phase B2 mutation / launch / official scoring rows: 0\n\n## Boundary\n- Question availability remains separate from display completeness and Method Map confidence.\n- Missing required visuals or rights blockers keep `complete_student_facing_question=false` while preserving source-map presence.\n- `blocked_quarantined` and `blocked_research_only` suppress student-facing method claims categorically.\n- No UI wording integration, rights approval, launch claim, official scoring claim, Phase B2 mutation, or remote Supabase mutation is performed.\n\n## Verification\n- `npm test -- --runInBand --runTestsByPath scripts/method-map/__tests__/full-beta-display-diagnostic-posture-map.test.js`\n- `node scripts/method-map/build-full-beta-display-diagnostic-posture-map.mjs --write`\n- `node scripts/method-map/build-full-beta-display-diagnostic-posture-map.mjs --check`\n- `npx eslint scripts/method-map/build-full-beta-display-diagnostic-posture-map.mjs scripts/method-map/__tests__/full-beta-display-diagnostic-posture-map.test.js`\n- `git diff --check`\n- `git diff --cached --check`\n- `npm run workflow:codex-preflight -- --json`\n\nCloses #1170","created_at":"2026-07-02T13:17:54Z","updated_at":"2026-07-02T13:31:39Z","closed_at":"2026-07-02T13:31:39Z","merged_at":"2026-07-02T13:31:39Z","merge_commit_sha":"3f266d1907168f1540e10b9df3c68ccb9e2e8e29","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/1183/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/1183/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/issues/1183/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/statuses/7da919bc6eae1d17d689a4414ce2042d756c98c3","head"